{"v":1,"ev":"ask","seq":1,"q":"local.client","title":"配置本机 Clash","message":"没找到 Clash Verge。可以用 cca 内置的代理：在这个 App 里跑一个 mihomo 内核，本机 127.0.0.1:7901–7904 每个端口走一个账号的节点，节点用在家时从路由器拷的那份。","fields":[{"id":"v","kind":"choice","label":"在外面走哪个","default":"1","options":[{"value":"1","label":"cca 内置的代理","note":"第一次要下载约 21MB"},{"value":"2","label":"手动配置别的 Clash 客户端","note":"基于 mihomo（Clash Meta 内核）的都可以"}]}]}
{"v":1,"ev":"ask","seq":2,"q":"local.manual","title":"手动配置本机 Clash","message":"基于 mihomo（Clash Meta 内核）的客户端都可以：把下面 listeners 和 proxy-groups 的条目分别追加到客户端配置（或覆写）里的同名列表，保存并重新加载，再打开它的外部控制（external-controller）。","fields":[{"id":"snippet","kind":"code","label":"要加的配置","value":"listeners:\n  - {name: cca-1, type: mixed, listen: 127.0.0.1, port: 7901, users: [], proxy: CCA-1}\n  - {name: cca-2, type: mixed, listen: 127.0.0.1, port: 7902, users: [], proxy: CCA-2}\nproxy-groups:\n  - {name: CCA-1, type: select, proxies: [\"US-A\", \"US-B\"]}\n  - {name: CCA-2, type: select, proxies: [\"US-B\", \"US-A\"]}"},{"id":"ctl","kind":"text","label":"外部控制地址","hint":"例如 127.0.0.1:9090；Unix socket 写 unix:/路径"},{"id":"secret","kind":"secret","label":"密钥（可选）","hint":"外部控制的 secret，没有就空着","optional":true}]}
{"v":1,"ev":"result","code":"local_ready","message":"本机端口池已就绪：127.0.0.1:7901–7904"}
